WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
- It's on the house, Deshaun.

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.500
- [Together:] Hang in there.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.750
- Poor guy’s life is a nightmare.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.291
- [Sigh]

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.625
- I try to clean house, but the dirt runs deep here.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:09.416
- The NFC East winner will be announced at the annual NFC Feast,

00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:11.250
and it is likely to be a team with a losing record.

00:00:11.375 --> 00:00:14.625
- What if a superteam…stole the NFC East spot?

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.916
- There’s technically nothing in the rule book that says you can’t.

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:19.166
- Delaware Clams, assemble.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.166
- YOU WANT CMC TO JOIN FAKE TEAM?

00:00:24.291 --> 00:00:25.875
It’s time for a recruiting montage.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.250
- Yes, let's go.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.250
- We’re looking for elite players.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:29.541
- I'll go.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:30.375
- Oh well, yeah.

00:00:30.541 --> 00:00:31.000
- I’m in.

00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:34.375
- It’s T.J. Hockenson, from the Lions. You guys came to ME.

00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:35.375
- [Together:] OH RIGHT, RIGHT.

00:00:35.625 --> 00:00:37.250
- Uh, do we have to include a Bengal?

00:00:37.541 --> 00:00:38.000
- SNEAK A-ZAC!

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:38.541
- [Together:] AHHH!

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:39.625
- Heard y'all needed a coach!

00:00:40.125 --> 00:00:42.791
- The goal is to seem so legit, they just hand us the trophy.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.250
- ONE, TWO, THREE…

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.000
- [Together:] CLAM UP!

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:46.375
- End of part one.

00:00:47.666 --> 00:00:48.250
- What is it?

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.625
Surprisingly great rates from State Farm!

00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:51.666
Wait, doesn't everyone get this?

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:52.375
- Uhhhh...

00:00:54.875 --> 00:00:56.291
- Whoa, who are these newcomers?

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.291
- Hello, I’m...BB Volt.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.000
I hate children and following your dreams.

00:01:00.166 --> 00:01:01.875
- Oh, God, I’m lying and I feel terrible about it.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.250
-  Have we breached their security yet?

00:01:03.375 --> 00:01:05.875
- LET US IN, COMPUTER!
- HACKING. INTO. MAINFRAME.

00:01:05.916 --> 00:01:08.375
- Huh, well you have football jerseys so, sure, come in.

00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:10.375
- OK, Younghoe. Go charm everyone.

00:01:10.416 --> 00:01:12.375
- Upright, upright, upright.

00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:13.375
- Hahaha!
- I like you!

00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:14.375
- Backs, are you in position?

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:15.750
- DROPPING THE JAG TO GET THE BAG.

00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:18.250
OH NO! MY LEG MAY OR MAY NOT BE CRAMPING.

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.750
My apologies, fantasy managers.

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:22.375
- Luckily, no one seems to be paying attention to James Robinson.

00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:25.666
- Used to be the Connecticut Clams before Mean Spamtos sold us out!

00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:27.416
- Clean exchange. Ready to run.

00:01:27.625 --> 00:01:28.750
- Hello, NFC East!

00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:30.916
- QUIET!
- RIVERA’S SO INSPIRING

00:01:31.041 --> 00:01:34.875
- Last few weeks we’ve been hot. The Giants, us, the Clams, I guess?

00:01:34.875 --> 00:01:37.375
- Ha, well we're 9-5! We played the Bengals and Jags and stuff!

00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:39.291
Oh god, am I addicted to lying?

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:40.625
- And the winner of the division...

00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:42.125
The Clams?!

00:01:42.375 --> 00:01:44.750
- Look, I never doubted the ol’ Zac Pack here for a second.

00:01:44.875 --> 00:01:47.375
- Wait...you NEVER doubted an NFC East team?

00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:48.375
- That doesn’t seem right.

00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:49.250
- They’re frauds!

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:49.625
- GET ‘EM!

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.625
- Yippee Younghoe, motherf--ker.

00:01:52.666 --> 00:01:53.416
- JALEN, DON’T RUN—

00:01:53.541 --> 00:01:54.833
- No, no, let him. He knows how.

00:01:54.916 --> 00:01:55.250
- Whoa.

00:01:55.416 --> 00:01:58.625
- Are you really going to attack me, feel-good story Alex Smith?

00:01:58.750 --> 00:01:59.916
- No. Here, man.

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.416
- F--K THAT. I’LL HIT ALEX SMITH TO GET BACK IN THE DANCE.

00:02:02.666 --> 00:02:03.916
- TEAMY, ATTACK.

00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:05.291
- UNLEASH CLAMMY.

00:02:05.541 --> 00:02:08.125
- TEAMY IS GETTING IT TOGETHER, RAWR!

00:02:08.333 --> 00:02:10.416
- GURGLE GURGLE. CLAM NOISES.

00:02:11.416 --> 00:02:13.250
- Hi, I’m Carson. I play for the Eagles.

00:02:13.416 --> 00:02:14.625
- Are you sure you do?

00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:15.250
- AHHHHH.

00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:19.041
- Hey Clam Fam, 

00:02:19.208 --> 00:02:23.750
Clammy here to announce that you can buy 
DELAWARE CLAMS shirts in the Bleacher Report shop.

00:02:24.041 --> 00:02:27.583
Now you can wear something that will make you constantly have to explain

00:02:27.875 --> 00:02:32.750
“Oh its a joke from a webseries.” So yeah, you’ll look pretty f--king cool. 

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:37.041
AND if you all buy enough shirts, they will free me back into the ocean!!

